🎬 Movie Ticket Booking System

A Movie Ticket Booking System developed using Java, JDBC, and MySQL.

This project allows users to view movies, theaters, and shows, book movie tickets, validate seat availability, and manage booking records using CRUD operations.

📌 Project Overview

The Movie Ticket Booking System is a console-based Java application that demonstrates how to connect a Java application with a MySQL database using JDBC (Java Database Connectivity).

The application provides functionality for:

Movie Management
Theater Management
Show Management
Movie Ticket Booking
Seat Validation
Booking Management
Transaction Management
Ticket Generation
CRUD Operations
🚀 Features
🎥 Movie Management
Add a new movie
View all movies
Search movie by ID
Update movie details
Delete movie
🏢 Theater Management
Add theater
View theaters
Update theater details
Delete theater
🎞️ Show Management
Add movie shows
View available shows
Display movie and theater details using SQL JOIN
Manage available seats
🎟️ Ticket Booking
Select a movie show
Enter customer details
Select number of seats
Validate available seats
Calculate ticket amount
Generate booking ID
Confirm booking
🔐 Transaction Management

The booking process uses JDBC transactions:

START TRANSACTION
       ↓
Check Available Seats
       ↓
Validate Seats
       ↓
Insert Booking
       ↓
Update Available Seats
       ↓
COMMIT

If any operation fails:

ROLLBACK

This prevents incorrect seat counts and incomplete bookings.

